@startuml
title Reacting to a Story
participant Viewer participant No_SPA_control participant DRF_API participant Notification_utility participant PostgreSQL
Viewer -> No_SPA_control : Backend endpoint available only
DRF_API -> DRF_API : POST stories/<id>/react/ [API-024]
DRF_API -> PostgreSQL : Upsert StoryReaction
DRF_API -> Notification_utility : create_notification(story_reaction)
Notification_utility -> PostgreSQL : Persist; on_commit publish
DRF_API -> No_SPA_control : 201/200 StoryReactionSerializer
@enduml
